### Heaven Pass API - colección de pruebas para la extensión "REST Client" de VSCode.
### Ejecutá cada bloque con el link "Send Request" que aparece arriba de cada ###.
### Corré el server primero: pnpm --filter @heaven-pass/api dev

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login dev (crea o reusa un usuario, devuelve un JWT). Solo existe fuera de producción.
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dev-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@heavenpass.com"
}

### Catálogo de fiestas (público, no requiere auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### Mis membresías
GET {{baseUrl}}/memberships
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Comprar una membresía VIP
# @name purchase
POST {{baseUrl}}/memberships
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plan": "VIP"
}

### Crear una reserva
### Reemplazá membershipId (respuesta de "purchase" o "Mis membresías") y eventId (respuesta del catálogo)
# @name reservation
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "membershipId": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_UN_ID_REAL",
  "eventId": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_UN_ID_REAL"
}

### Confirmar la reserva (mueve reserved -> sold en el EventSlot)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservation.response.body.$.id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Cancelar la reserva
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservation.response.body.$.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "cambio de planes"
}

### Agregar un extra (late entry, seguro de clima, upgrade)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservation.response.body.$.id}}/extras
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "LATE_ENTRY"
}

### Webhook de pago (simula al proveedor confirmando un cargo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/payments
Content-Type: application/json
x-webhook-secret: dev-only-change-me-as-well

{
  "provider": "PAYMENTS",
  "eventType": "payment.succeeded",
  "referenceType": "MEMBERSHIP",
  "referenceId": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_UN_ID_REAL",
  "amountCents": 79000,
  "currency": "USD",
  "occurredAt": "2026-07-23T00:00:00.000Z"
}
